---
import SlideShell from '@talks/shared/components/SlideShell.astro';
---

<div class="slide content-slide synthesis-slide">
  <SlideShell number="10" total="11" label="Punto de síntesis" />
  <h2 class="title">LA CARRERA SE DECIDE <span class="g">FUERA DEL MODELO</span></h2>
  <p class="synthesis-note">No basta con el mejor chip, el modelo más grande o la mayor inversión.</p>

  <div class="synthesis-equation" aria-label="La inteligencia artificial se convierte en poder económico, industrial, militar y geopolítico">
    <span class="equation-node equation-input">IA</span>
    <span class="equation-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <span class="equation-node equation-output">poder</span>
    <span class="equation-qualifier">económico · industrial · militar · geopolítico</span>
  </div>

  <div class="ecosystem-grid" aria-label="Dos ecosistemas tecnológicos en competencia">
    <section class="ecosystem ecosystem-us">
      <div class="ecosystem-head">
        <span class="ecosystem-kicker">Estados Unidos</span>
        <span class="ecosystem-side">Ventaja inicial</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="ecosystem-list">
        <li><strong>Infraestructura</strong><span>Nube, centros de datos y energía.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Chips</strong><span>Diseño y acceso al cómputo de frontera.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Inversión</strong><span>Capital privado para escalar rápido.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Modelos</strong><span>Laboratorios líderes en la frontera.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="ecosystem ecosystem-china">
      <div class="ecosystem-head">
        <span class="ecosystem-kicker">China</span>
        <span class="ecosystem-side">Ruta de aceleración</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="ecosystem-list">
        <li><strong>Eficiencia</strong><span>Más rendimiento con menos cómputo.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Apertura</strong><span>Modelos abiertos, baratos y adaptables.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Industria</strong><span>Producción y despliegue a escala.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Mundo físico</strong><span>Fábricas, logística y sistemas autónomos.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="synthesis-outlook">
    <span class="outlook-label">Desenlace probable</span>
    <strong>No una victoria total: dos ecosistemas tecnológicos.</strong>
    <span class="outlook-detail">Prioridades y modelos estratégicos distintos.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .synthesis-slide {
    align-items: stretch;
    padding: 40px 4.5vw 40px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .synthesis-slide .title {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 1080px;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.4vw, 4.15rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: 0.025em;
  }

  .synthesis-note {
    margin: 14px 0 18px;
    color: #a8c8b8;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.45vw, 1.28rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .synthesis-equation {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto 22px;
    padding: 12px 18px 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 232, 122, 0.18);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 232, 122, 0.18);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .equation-node {
    font-family: var(--font-d);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.7vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .equation-input { color: var(--green); }
  .equation-output { color: var(--purple); }
  .equation-arrow { color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .equation-qualifier {
    color: #a8c8b8;
    font-family: var(--font-m);
    font-size: clamp(0.68rem, 1vw, 0.82rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ecosystem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(20px, 4vw, 52px);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ecosystem {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 18px 20px 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(15, 35, 24, 0.94), rgba(7, 19, 13, 0.78));
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 232, 122, 0.14);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--green);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
  }

  .ecosystem-china {
    border-color: rgba(200, 85, 245, 0.18);
    border-top-color: var(--purple);
  }

  .ecosystem-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .ecosystem-kicker,
  .ecosystem-side,
  .ecosystem-list strong,
  .outlook-label {
    font-family: var(--font-m);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ecosystem-kicker {
    color: var(--green);
    font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1.1vw, 0.94rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .ecosystem-china .ecosystem-kicker { color: var(--purple); }

  .ecosystem-side {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .ecosystem-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .ecosystem-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(104px, 0.72fr) 1.28fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(138, 184, 158, 0.14);
  }

  .ecosystem-list strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: clamp(0.63rem, 0.82vw, 0.73rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .ecosystem-list span {
    color: #a8c8b8;
    font-size: clamp(0.82rem, 1.05vw, 0.98rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .synthesis-outlook {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 16px;
    margin: 21px auto 0;
    color: #b9cfc4;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .outlook-label {
    color: var(--red);
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .synthesis-outlook strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-d);
    font-size: clamp(0.92rem, 1.45vw, 1.18rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .outlook-detail {
    color: #8ab89e;
    font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1vw, 0.9rem);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .synthesis-slide { overflow-y: auto; }
    .ecosystem-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  }

  @media (max-height: 760px) {
    .synthesis-slide { padding-top: 32px; padding-bottom: 32px; }
    .synthesis-note { margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 13px; }
    .synthesis-equation { margin-bottom: 16px; padding-top: 9px; padding-bottom: 10px; }
    .ecosystem { padding-top: 14px; padding-bottom: 10px; }
    .ecosystem-list li { padding: 8px 0; }
    .synthesis-outlook { margin-top: 15px; }
  }
</style>
